{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:391:295:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/386/dialogueEntries/40/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/386/dialogueEntries/40/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=2]Obviously it’s gotta be a critter here, and really I’m just happy to see the spirit of The Saint living on.", "context": {"actorId": "9", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act2/botbMabel/Lore02_Augustus", "conversationId": 391, "entryId": 295, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[391, 296]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "38a441c9cfabbc22c351cb32a509ede186e59c49de8440e2d64b3ee1e8bd3ca6", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=2]من الواضح أنه لا بد أن يكون أحد السكان هنا، ويسعدني حقا أن أرى روح القديس مستمرة فحسب.", "targetSha256": "21d4d2fe61b4f52a9a7153649c12152e7fbb28d0cad3fb3bb64698abd841848a"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:415:717:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/414/dialogueEntries/6/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/414/dialogueEntries/6/fields/6/value"}], "source": "This one’s from a new friend!", "context": {"actorId": "1", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "9", "conversation": "act3/cookieQuest/03_CD_augustus", "conversationId": 415, "entryId": 717, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[415, 718]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "23dabcf742c75f3838bcccc008c5cea522ae0da8c260d164fe29fbd3868be80f", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "هذه من أحد الأصدقاء الجدد!", "targetSha256": "4f0fd912935a3c54edfc33739eec9c2ba1a2bed6bb95a63f9375a3f78721f576"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:447:735:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/446/dialogueEntries/30/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/446/dialogueEntries/30/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Anyways that’s about it. Once I’m spent, I’ll clean up my mess, with my tongue might I add, and call it a day!", "context": {"actorId": "19", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/rascalSoloFluidsStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 447, "entryId": 735, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[447, 736]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "6181aa07bcdbe3fc3f6d161ecf960f237cb1ad1ef4351ca3a8390170b7c86017", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "على أي حال، هذا كل شيء تقريبا. حين أُستنزف، أنظف ما خلفته، بلساني، إن جاز لي أن أضيف، وأكتفي بذلك!", "targetSha256": "84f203a4c69ccbfe55a7d93334970a4ada71b193c10f8ff0b193ad88f568a4b3"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:477:824:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/506/dialogueEntries/96/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/506/dialogueEntries/96/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Hahahaaa. Y’know… For once I’m glad someone didn’t last too long.", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/mabelRascalMovie/dialogue", "conversationId": 477, "entryId": 824, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[477, 825]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "acba18caaf8b5a59c16932cd5c1a9d81291eaa166f7ed35339223dd9c90197e2", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "هاهاهااا. أتعلم… على غير عادتي، يسعدني أن أحدا لم يصمد طويلا.", "targetSha256": "bf2aa860999eae2fd9cd7575ac16eec302114bc6deed28ee209a5adbba9336d1"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:492:773:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/521/dialogueEntries/27/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/521/dialogueEntries/27/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=7]Yeah, just that they’re <waitfor=0.5>a bit <waitfor=0.5>unlike the other critters here.", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/fireflies/02_collectingFireflies", "conversationId": 492, "entryId": 773, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[492, 774]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "965516465f6a875ea006d7f0f565b51def75b35bdf6de7241476e8ae073ba172", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=7]نعم، فهم <waitfor=0.5>مختلفون قليلا <waitfor=0.5>عن بقية السكان هنا.", "targetSha256": "83623391c4fba4273b564c61123d4a01eb21d6dc6677edb71009253fb5af8a70"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:492:775:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/521/dialogueEntries/29/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/521/dialogueEntries/29/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=7]Heh, right. <waitfor=0.5>So for starters, <waitfor=0.5>they don’t really speak our tongue.", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/fireflies/02_collectingFireflies", "conversationId": 492, "entryId": 775, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[492, 776]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "b3f95ad7055f0bbaede0c45cefd7f5d262f29d3e2fa71bbbd0ad6a54a3a676cd", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=7]هه، صحيح. <waitfor=0.5>بداية، <waitfor=0.5>هم لا يتحدثون لغتنا حقا.", "targetSha256": "14ed96cda1f12de4454be18132a2923b8ae97be9e17a7fd2ce965a1be7432099"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:510:940:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/539/dialogueEntries/11/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/539/dialogueEntries/11/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=1]I always give him a friendly smile and wave though! <pause>I figured he must be shy.", "context": {"actorId": "8", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "act3/wolfQuest/02_askAround_penny", "conversationId": 510, "entryId": 940, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[510, 941]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "58ea84a3067fe21e22f012d62d631da1389b831ab4026f124e75d5c46732cdad", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=1]لكنني أبتسم له وألوح بود دائما! <pause>ظننت أنه لا بد أن يكون خجولا.", "targetSha256": "3efef547b10b81b4797a8108fd101afecafafd73000c6cdab648e10756e98fb5"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:57:2:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/219/dialogueEntries/2/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/219/dialogueEntries/2/fields/6/value"}], "source": "Not that I can blame you. Not a lot of critters last long with me…", "context": {"actorId": "2", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/bunnyHandjob/dialogue", "conversationId": 57, "entryId": 2, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[57, 3]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "d67c6bcf6b70737a168d73a79a637cd05e3d66f89e22dfd391044b8a800b61bd", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "ولا أستطيع أن ألومك. فقليل من المخلوقات يصمدون طويلا معي…", "targetSha256": "d105c4b6ae0d57c630f15a49212ae59f7df610c281a9c4f2e9d829213d8a6806"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:938:704:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/469/dialogueEntries/4/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/469/dialogueEntries/4/fields/6/value"}], "source": "[pic=4]We still have those benefits, might I add!", "context": {"actorId": "25", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "gossip/fox/melodyAndPenny", "conversationId": 938, "entryId": 704, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[938, 705]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "17c5ea8c48aab3040ad3223db24a0134393b7c3c90516709f19dfbacf1488299", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "[pic=4]وما زلنا نتمتع بتلك المنافع، إن جاز لي أن أضيف!", "targetSha256": "21be22f9ae380170d386eaf85466754cd1b6e6cc801d7903d3473b6d9bc6407d"}
{"family": "dialogue", "id": "ds:955:890:Dialogue Text", "selectors": [{"asset": "StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/defaultlocalgroup_assets_all_298c5a4d1d1846b1a8d2c7d5da3f319c.bundle", "kind": "field", "pathId": -9011735310751668748, "pointer": "/conversations/486/dialogueEntries/81/fields/6/value"}, {"asset": "sharedassets0.assets", "kind": "field", "pathId": 3336, "pointer": "/conversations/486/dialogueEntries/81/fields/6/value"}], "source": "And what on earth is Mia telling you.", "context": {"actorId": "5", "conditions": "", "conversantId": "1", "conversation": "movies/mabelCumSpaStory/dialogue", "conversationId": 955, "entryId": 890, "field": "Dialogue Text", "next": [[955, 891]], "script": ""}, "sourceSha256": "4843605210424899080f365aea6f3ba5008a5c6bf20bbaaa1f8e47a2e090f375", "preserveExactly": false, "target": "وما الذي تسمعه من ميا يا ترى.", "targetSha256": "9874582caf55ecf5dce78eff7073e41107dd30ba62d0d5a2efca6babfe7779d8"}
